<title>USA: Teletouch names Thomas McLemore CFO.</title>
<headline>Teletouch names Thomas McLemore CFO.</headline>
<dateline>TYLER, Texas 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teletouch Communciations Inc on Tuesday said Thomas McLemore has been named chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said McLemore replaces Michael Rosen, who left the company in January.</p>
<p>McLemore was hired in January as interim chief financial officer and vice president for finance, the company said.</p>
